 "brief": "The Izz ad-Din al-Qassam Brigades, the military wing of Hamas, released video footage of Omar Muhammad Abu Jalala, commander of the naval force in Khan Younis, Shehab Wire reported. The material showed Abu Jalala during preparation and readiness operations. Abu Jalala held the rank of field commander in the organization's naval wing.\n\nThe video release followed Abu Jalala's death. No details on the circumstances or timing of his death were provided in the footage announcement. The brigades regularly publish military videos documenting operations and personnel.",
